{
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "n-summary",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## 磁介质公式汇总\n\n磁化 → H矢量 → 介质安培环路 → 分类/边界条件 → 铁磁质",
			"x": 430,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 120
		},
		{
			"id": "n-magnetization",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**磁介质的磁化**\n\n$$\\vec{M} = \\frac{\\sum\\vec{m}}{\\Delta V}$$\n\n$$\\vec{J}_s = \\nabla\\times\\vec{M}$$\n\n$$\\vec{K}_s = \\vec{M}\\times\\hat{n}$$",
			"x": 30,
			"y": 200,
			"width": 310,
			"height": 220
		},
		{
			"id": "n-h",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**磁场强度**\n\n$$\\vec{H} = \\frac{\\vec{B}}{\\mu_0} - \\vec{M}$$\n\n$$\\vec{B} = \\mu\\vec{H}$$\n\n$$\\mu = \\mu_0\\mu_r$$",
			"x": 400,
			"y": 200,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 200
		},
		{
			"id": "n-ampere-media",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**磁介质的安培环路定理**\n\n$$\\oint \\vec{H}\\cdot d\\vec{l} = \\sum I_f$$\n\n$$\\nabla\\times\\vec{H} = \\vec{J}_f$$",
			"x": 770,
			"y": 200,
			"width": 330,
			"height": 200
		},
		{
			"id": "n-classification",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**磁介质的分类**\n\n顺磁：$\\chi_m>0,\\;\\mu_r>1$\n\n抗磁：$\\chi_m<0,\\;\\mu_r<1$\n\n铁磁：$\\chi_m\\gg0,\\;\\mu_r\\gg1$",
			"x": 30,
			"y": 520,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 180
		},
		{
			"id": "n-bc",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**磁介质边界条件**\n\n$$B_{1n} = B_{2n}$$\n\n$$H_{1\\tau} = H_{2\\tau}$$\n\n$$\\frac{\\tan\\theta_1}{\\tan\\theta_2} = \\frac{\\mu_{r1}}{\\mu_{r2}}$$",
			"x": 400,
			"y": 520,
			"width": 310,
			"height": 210
		},
		{
			"id": "n-ferro",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**铁磁质**\n\n磁畴 → 磁滞回线\n\n剩磁 $B_r$、矫顽力 $H_c$\n\n软磁($H_c$小) 硬磁($H_c$大)\n\n居里温度 $T_C$",
			"x": 770,
			"y": 520,
			"width": 310,
			"height": 220
		}
	],
	"edges": [
		{
			"id": "e1",
			"fromNode": "n-magnetization",
			"fromSide": "right",
			"toNode": "n-h",
			"toSide": "left",
			"label": "M → H = B/μ₀-M"
		},
		{
			"id": "e2",
			"fromNode": "n-h",
			"fromSide": "right",
			"toNode": "n-ampere-media",
			"toSide": "left",
			"label": "H → ∮H·dl = I_f"
		},
		{
			"id": "e3",
			"fromNode": "n-ampere-media",
			"fromSide": "bottom",
			"toNode": "n-bc",
			"toSide": "top",
			"label": "H_τ 条件"
		},
		{
			"id": "e4",
			"fromNode": "n-h",
			"fromSide": "bottom",
			"toNode": "n-classification",
			"toSide": "top",
			"label": "χ_m, μ_r → 分类"
		},
		{
			"id": "e5",
			"fromNode": "n-classification",
			"fromSide": "right",
			"toNode": "n-ferro",
			"toSide": "left",
			"label": "铁磁质 → 磁畴/磁滞"
		}
	]
}
